  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the organisation of the 2025 LAS Exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the annual LAS Exchange is to provide a space for project partners to share experiences and learnings from their projects, to hear from others and get inspired, to facilitate adaptive programming and initiative collaborations, with the ultimate goal to increase the impact of the different LAS projects. The LAS Exchange in Colombia has featured the work of the LAS partners: Conexi&#xf3;n &#x2013; ICCO Cooperaci&#xf3;n, Tropenbos International and Kadaster International.</narrative>
  </description>
